Rebalanced .50 AE Explosive; velocity increased from 400m/s to 420m/s, penetration reduced from 914.4mm to 279.4mm, damage after penetration and penetration chance reduced from 40% to 15%, making the round now act much more like an Explosive round compared to AP-I
